wait a second. If we just type a request, we&nbsp;
already get search answers. They are right&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:23.940 --> 00:01:31.080
there. We have been able to do this for more&nbsp;
than a decade now. So, what’s new here? Why is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:31.080 --> 00:01:37.740
this interesting? What are the advantages of this&nbsp;
AI assistant compared to just a regular search?

00:01:37.740 --> 00:01:43.860
Well, let’s have a look together. The first&nbsp;
thing that catches the eye is that we can ask&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:43.860 --> 00:01:50.520
it questions that are really specific. For&nbsp;
instance, here, we are asking not just for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:50.520 --> 00:01:58.080
