00:03:40.200 --> 00:03:46.800
gangster math tutor right at our fingertips,&nbsp;
who can process more information than any of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:46.800 --> 00:03:52.920
us humans can. And all this for free for&nbsp;
all of us. What an incredible tool this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:52.920 --> 00:03:58.800
